C. Event persistence visibility
--------------------------------------------------

The current in-memory bus silently ignores event envelope validation failures when persisting to the event store.

Fix this.

Requirements:
- Do not silently swallow validation/persistence issues.
- In development/test mode, prefer fail-fast behavior or explicit exception raising.
- At minimum, emit structured error logs with enough context.
- Make the behavior configurable if needed:
  - strict mode
  - permissive mode

The default for local development should favor visibility over silence.

